WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.850
You know, when I'm coaching
athletes in the gym, I love to

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.130
remind them of the
value of presence.

3
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.610
And I'm not talking about
presents under a tree, right?

4
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.850
I'm talking about the
other kind of presence.

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.490
I'm talking about being
present in the moment.

6
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.890
That is an essential
piece of fitness training.

7
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:26.570
Why? Because quality work
leads to quality fitness.

8
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.690
And I love to tell an athlete,
man, if you don't like the

9
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.090
quality of your fitness, you
need to check the quality of your

10
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:38.090
work because there is a
relationship between those two.

11
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:42.810
And if you just walk in and you
just kind of do whatever and

12
00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.210
your mind's checked out and
you're thinking about a million

13
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:49.690
other things, the quality that
you could have gotten from that

14
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.710
fitness session suffers.

15
00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.950
Now think about how that
applies in your spiritual life.

16
00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:58.780
Lord.

17
00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.170
We're just grateful, God.

18
00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.050
We're grateful for you.

19
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.850
We're grateful that
you are with us, Lord.

20
00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.120
We are just leaning in.

21
00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:11.250
God, just realizing that we
need more of you even now, Lord.

22
00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:15.250
We need clean fuel,
we need fuel for our souls.

23
00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:20.900
Lord, thank you that it's all
right here and it's all available

24
00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:25.620
to us. And as we just sit
here with you, Lord, using

25
00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:30.100
these same practices that
the church has been doing for

26
00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:35.140
thousands of years, not only
do we feel more connected

27
00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.500
to all those who have gone before
us, more importantly, Lord, we

28
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.740
feel connected to you.

29
00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.870
In Jesus' name, amen.

